1. F6 复检：runtime_probe.start_node 是否继承 probe 进程组
---------------------------------------------------------------------
$ grep -rn "start_new_session" ws/src/90_platform/v8_platform/local_planner/ ws/src/90_platform/v8_platform/regression/
regression/a5_gazebo_runtime.py:124:                                     start_new_session=False)
